OL,3,AEnding corridor care in hospitals for
OL,4,Achildren will be a priority, says
OL,5,Ahealth secretary
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe number of people waiting more than
OL,8,F12 hours in A&E departments from a
OL,9,Fdecision to admit to actually being
OL,10,Fadmitted stood at 50,582 in September,
OL,11,Fup from 44,951 in August.
